@username = {{$random.name.username}}

### Create new Account
POST {{ServerAddress}}/api/admin/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("http-client")}}

{
  "username": "{{username}}"
}

### Get Account
GET {{ServerAddress}}/api/admin/accounts/{{username}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("http-client")}}

### Update Account
PATCH {{ServerAddress}}/api/admin/accounts/{{username}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("http-client")}}

{
  "password": "{{$random.internet.password}}"
}

### Disable Account
DELETE {{ServerAddress}}/api/admin/accounts/{{username}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("http-client")}}
